§ BatchEscapeFixture

-- Regression fixture for `l4 batch` string-literal escaping (target T11).
-- The exported function's body deliberately ignores its parameter so the
-- test isolates payload escaping from unrelated name-resolution behaviour.

@export Return a fixed token regardless of input
GIVEN payload IS A STRING @desc unused; the test exercises payload escaping only
echoFixed payload MEANS "ok"
